//! Reconnect backoff for s2s channels.
//!
//! Short first step, doubling to a 30s cap. The loops this replaces started at
//! 2-3s, so after a peer restart they were already sleeping 30s between dials
//! by the time the peer came back, and the service sat disconnected for 1-2
//! minutes after its dependency was up again.

